Package: libcolord-dev
Version: @DEB_COLORD_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libcolord2 (= @DEB_COLORD_V@), liblcms2-dev, libglib2.0-dev
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Description: system service to manage device colour profiles -- development files
 colord is a system service that makes it easy to manage, install and generate
 colour profiles to accurately colour-manage input and output devices.
 .
 This package contains the development headers and pkg-config file for the
 libcolord client library found in libcolord2.
